<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  robot: drone_v2 | consumers: RViz / robot_state_publisher, Gazebo, CAD Viewer
  units: meters, kilograms, radians | frames: +X forward (nose), +Y left, +Z up (REP-103)
  root: base_link | source of dimensions: Assem1.SLDASM (SolidWorks, repo root), read via COM
  meshes: meshes/, STL exported per-link in the link frame, source units m, no scale
    - scripts/sw_tess.py tessellates every visible leaf part of Assem1.SLDASM (part frame + transform)
    - scripts/build_meshes.py moves them into the link frames, decimates, writes STL, prints inertials
  inertials: SolidWorks mass properties per part, combined (parallel-axis) per link by build_meshes.py;
    whole-drone sum checked against SolidWorks assembly mass properties (mass 0.81798 kg, tensor equal,
    Assem1.SLDASM 2026-10-25 with the MG90 gripper)
  links:
    base_link        physical; everything except the 4 propellers, the tilting camera and the moving
                     gripper parts (frame, arms, motors, FC, Pi 5, battery, sensors, camera servo +
                     bracket GiaCam3, MG90 body + GiaPinServo + jaw pin plate GiaPin-1, landing legs).
                     Origin = centre of the 4 motor axes, height = FC board plane (fc-1 origin).
    prop_front_left  physical; frame = propeller hub on the motor axis, axes parallel to base_link
    prop_front_right, prop_rear_left, prop_rear_right: same
    camera_tilt_link physical; GiaCam3A + Camera Module. Frame on the servo output axis; at joint 0
                     its axes are parallel to base_link and the lens looks straight down (-Z)
  joints (all continuous, parent base_link, hub at z=+0.036, motor axis distance 0.2878 m):
    prop_front_left_joint   xyz=(+0.20349 +0.20349 0.036)  axis 0 0 -1  (CW prop)
    prop_front_right_joint  xyz=(+0.20349 -0.20349 0.036)  axis 0 0 1   (CCW prop)
    prop_rear_left_joint    xyz=(-0.20349 +0.20349 0.036)  axis 0 0 1   (CCW prop)
    prop_rear_right_joint   xyz=(-0.20349 -0.20349 0.036)  axis 0 0 -1  (CW prop)
    positive joint motion = the propeller's real spin direction
  camera_tilt_joint: revolute, parent base_link, xyz=(0.09525 -0.018 -0.05218), axis 0 -1 0
    angle 0 = looking straight down, positive = view tilts towards the nose, so the
    joint angle in rad equals tilt_deg of drone_mission/camera_tilt.py (mission.yaml table).
    Source: CAD mate Concentric91 (servo shaft <-> GiaCam3A), the only free DOF of GiaCam3A;
    lens direction from mate Concentric92. CAD pose had no angle mate (80.7 deg on 10-22), outside the
    servo range, so the mesh is rotated back to the 0 pose by scripts/build_meshes.py.
    (CAD pose 98.2 deg in the 10-25 assembly.)
    limits -36.0 .. 48.8 deg = ends of the tilt table (mission.yaml, 2026-10-22; -36 = grip angle)
  gripper (MG90 under the battery strap, 2026-10-25): every pin is parallel to base_link X, every
    link frame sits on its pin with axes parallel to base_link, joint 0 = CAD pose.
    gripper_servo_joint   revolute, base_link -> gripper_servo_link (MG90 gear/horn + shaft),
                          xyz=(-0.00225 0 -0.08462), axis 1 0 0. THE ACTUATED JOINT.
                          0 = CAD pose = jaws fully CLOSED: horn in line with the rods (toggle, self
                          locking), finger gap 119.2 mm = holds the 120 mm box.
                          -120 deg = OPEN: gap 242 mm, finger bottoms at z -0.153 (leg plane -0.155).
                          The mechanism is symmetric in +/- servo angle; the negative side is used.
    gripper_rod_left_joint   servo link -> CauNoi-2, on the horn hole y -9.27 mm (rods cross over)
    gripper_rod_right_joint  servo link -> CauNoi-3, on the horn hole y +9.27 mm
    gripper_jaw_left_joint   base_link -> GapHang-1 (+Y jaw), pin xyz=(0.0025 0.03151 -0.0625)
    gripper_jaw_right_joint  base_link -> GapHang-2 (-Y jaw), pin xyz=(0.0025 -0.0315 -0.0625)
    Each side is a closed four-bar (horn r 9.27 mm, rod 43.80 mm, jaw ear r 22.05 mm, pins from
    mates Concentric101/102/117/118/121/122). URDF cannot close loops: the rod -> jaw ear pin is
    cut and the 4 passive joints <mimic> the servo with a line through the exact closed and open
    poses. Max mimic error over 0..-120 deg: jaw_left 10.2, jaw_right 7.4, rod_left 9.2,
    rod_right 2.7 deg. Exact angles: four_bar() in scripts/build_meshes.py (the Gazebo sim drives
    the 4 joints from the exact solution). Jaw opening is not symmetric (left 42.0, right 33.8
    deg at -120) because the two rods cross on one horn.
  collision: base_link = bounding box of the base mesh (envelope incl. motors and legs);
             props = disc cylinder r 0.1016 (8 in) over the blade thickness;
             jaws = bounding box of the jaw mesh; servo horn and rods have none
  assumptions:
  - NOSE: assembly has no marked forward; +X is taken as the diagonal towards the camera
    (assembly +X+Z), with the optical flow/ToF on the opposite diagonal. Verify against the FC arrow.
  - assembly up axis = +Y (props above motors), mapped to base_link +Z
  - CW/CCW taken from the propeller part names, as seen from above; matches Betaflight
    Quad-X "props in" (front-left CW)
  - MASSES ARE CAD ESTIMATES: almost every part uses SolidWorks default density 1000 kg/m^3
    (motors 9.7 g in CAD vs ~50 g real, battery 158 g). Weigh the drone and rescale before
    using these inertials for dynamics.
  - 48 stator coils (inside the motor bells) are left out of the visual mesh, kept in the inertia
  - vendor STEP parts decimated to <= 4000 triangles each in the visual mesh
  - camera_tilt effort 0.16 N*m / velocity 10.5 rad/s from the ES08MD II datasheet (1.6 kg*cm,
    0.10 s/60 deg), not measured
  - gripper_servo effort 0.18 N*m / velocity 10.5 rad/s from the MG90 datasheet (1.8 kg*cm,
    0.10 s/60 deg), not measured; servo pulse <-> angle not calibrated, and which servo direction
    opens on the real drone is not checked (CAD only fixes |angle|)
-->

<robot name="drone_v2">
  <link name="base_link">
    <inertial>
      <origin xyz="0.00468 -0.00017 -0.02565" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <mass value="0.75082" />
      <!-- SolidWorks mass properties combined by scripts/build_meshes.py, about COM, base_link axes -->
      <inertia ixx="6.5855e-03" ixy="-6.676e-06" ixz="6.128e-05" iyy="7.1876e-03" iyz="-6.558e-07" izz="1.2715e-02" />
    </inertial>
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <mesh filename="meshes/base_link.stl" />
      </geometry>
      <material name="frame_grey">
        <color rgba="0.35 0.35 0.38 1" />
      </material>
    </visual>
    <collision>
      <!-- base mesh bbox: x,y +-0.2247, z -0.155..0.078 -->
      <origin xyz="0 0 -0.0385" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <box size="0.4494 0.4494 0.233" />
      </geometry>
    </collision>
  </link>
  <link name="prop_front_left">
    <inertial>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0.00128" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <mass value="0.00611" />
      <inertia ixx="1.2028e-05" ixy="2.996e-06" ixz="0" iyy="9.1273e-07" iyz="0" izz="1.2887e-05" />
    </inertial>
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <mesh filename="meshes/prop_front_left.stl" />
      </geometry>
      <material name="prop_cw">
        <color rgba="0.1 0.1 0.1 1" />
      </material>
    </visual>
    <collision>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0.00125" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <cylinder radius="0.1016" length="0.0095" />
      </geometry>
    </collision>
  </link>
  <link name="prop_front_right">
    <inertial>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0.00129" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <mass value="0.00611" />
      <inertia ixx="1.2573e-05" ixy="1.626e-06" ixz="0" iyy="3.6951e-07" iyz="0" izz="1.2888e-05" />
    </inertial>
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <mesh filename="meshes/prop_front_right.stl" />
      </geometry>
      <material name="prop_ccw">
        <color rgba="0.8 0.3 0.1 1" />
      </material>
    </visual>
    <collision>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0.00125" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <cylinder radius="0.1016" length="0.0095" />
      </geometry>
    </collision>
  </link>
  <link name="prop_rear_left">
    <inertial>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0.00129" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <mass value="0.00611" />
      <inertia ixx="3.9718e-06" ixy="-5.799e-06" ixz="0" iyy="8.9705e-06" iyz="0" izz="1.2888e-05" />
    </inertial>
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <mesh filename="meshes/prop_rear_left.stl" />
      </geometry>
      <material name="prop_ccw" />
    </visual>
    <collision>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0.00125" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <cylinder radius="0.1016" length="0.0095" />
      </geometry>
    </collision>
  </link>
  <link name="prop_rear_right">
    <inertial>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0.00128" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <mass value="0.00611" />
      <inertia ixx="5.3798e-06" ixy="-6.219e-06" ixz="0" iyy="7.5613e-06" iyz="0" izz="1.2887e-05" />
    </inertial>
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <mesh filename="meshes/prop_rear_right.stl" />
      </geometry>
      <material name="prop_cw" />
    </visual>
    <collision>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0.00125" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <cylinder radius="0.1016" length="0.0095" />
      </geometry>
    </collision>
  </link>
  <link name="camera_tilt_link">
    <inertial>
      <origin xyz="0.00046 0.01756 -0.01711" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <mass value="0.00914" />
      <inertia ixx="2.9758e-06" ixy="2.205e-09" ixz="5.890e-09" iyy="1.5371e-06" iyz="-8.520e-08" izz="2.0623e-06" />
    </inertial>
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <mesh filename="meshes/camera_tilt_link.stl" />
      </geometry>
      <material name="camera_green">
        <color rgba="0.1 0.5 0.3 1" />
      </material>
    </visual>
    <collision>
      <!-- camera_tilt_link mesh bbox: x -0.0125..0.015, y -0.003..0.037, z -0.0418..0.01 -->
      <origin xyz="0.00125 0.017 -0.0159" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <box size="0.0275 0.04 0.0518" />
      </geometry>
    </collision>
  </link>
  <link name="gripper_servo_link">
    <inertial>
      <origin xyz="-0.00153 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <mass value="0.00053" />
      <inertia ixx="3.4802e-08" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="4.1397e-09" iyz="-2.257e-10" izz="3.2306e-08" />
    </inertial>
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <mesh filename="meshes/gripper_servo_link.stl" />
      </geometry>
      <material name="gripper_white">
        <color rgba="0.9 0.9 0.9 1" />
      </material>
    </visual>
  </link>
  <link name="gripper_rod_left">
    <inertial>
      <origin xyz="0.0015 0.02227 0.00224" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <mass value="0.00078" />
      <inertia ixx="1.6920e-07" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="6.7631e-09" iyz="8.777e-09" izz="1.6360e-07" />
    </inertial>
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <mesh filename="meshes/gripper_rod_left.stl" />
      </geometry>
      <material name="gripper_white" />
    </visual>
  </link>
  <link name="gripper_rod_right">
    <inertial>
      <origin xyz="0.0015 -0.0223 -0.00196" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <mass value="0.00078" />
      <inertia ixx="1.6920e-07" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="7.0117e-09" iyz="1.077e-08" izz="1.6335e-07" />
    </inertial>
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <mesh filename="meshes/gripper_rod_right.stl" />
      </geometry>
      <material name="gripper_white" />
    </visual>
  </link>
  <link name="gripper_jaw_left">
    <inertial>
      <origin xyz="-0.003 0.02411 -0.04402" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <mass value="0.01576" />
      <inertia ixx="2.4303e-05" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="2.4654e-05" iyz="6.557e-06" izz="6.3362e-06" />
    </inertial>
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <mesh filename="meshes/gripper_jaw_left.stl" />
      </geometry>
      <material name="gripper_orange">
        <color rgba="0.9 0.5 0.1 1" />
      </material>
    </visual>
    <collision>
      <!-- jaw mesh bbox: x -0.0235..0.0175, y -0.0066..0.0447, z -0.1303..0.0069 -->
      <origin xyz="-0.003 0.01905 -0.0617" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <box size="0.041 0.0513 0.1372" />
      </geometry>
    </collision>
  </link>
  <link name="gripper_jaw_right">
    <inertial>
      <origin xyz="-0.003 -0.0241 -0.04403" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <mass value="0.01576" />
      <inertia ixx="2.4303e-05" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="2.4660e-05" iyz="-6.550e-06" izz="6.3308e-06" />
    </inertial>
    <visual>
      <origin xyz="0 0 0" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <mesh filename="meshes/gripper_jaw_right.stl" />
      </geometry>
      <material name="gripper_orange" />
    </visual>
    <collision>
      <!-- jaw mesh bbox: x -0.0235..0.0175, y -0.0447..0.0066, z -0.1303..0.0069 -->
      <origin xyz="-0.003 -0.01905 -0.0617" rpy="0 0 0" />
      <geometry>
        <box size="0.041 0.0513 0.1372" />
      </geometry>
    </collision>
  </link>
  <joint name="prop_front_left_joint" type="continuous">
    <parent link="base_link" />
    <child link="prop_front_left" />
    <origin xyz="0.20349 0.20349 0.036" rpy="0 0 0" />
    <axis xyz="0 0 -1" />
  </joint>
  <joint name="prop_front_right_joint" type="continuous">
    <parent link="base_link" />
    <child link="prop_front_right" />
    <origin xyz="0.20349 -0.20349 0.036" rpy="0 0 0" />
    <axis xyz="0 0 1" />
  </joint>
  <joint name="prop_rear_left_joint" type="continuous">
    <parent link="base_link" />
    <child link="prop_rear_left" />
    <origin xyz="-0.20349 0.20349 0.036" rpy="0 0 0" />
    <axis xyz="0 0 1" />
  </joint>
  <joint name="prop_rear_right_joint" type="continuous">
    <parent link="base_link" />
    <child link="prop_rear_right" />
    <origin xyz="-0.20349 -0.20349 0.036" rpy="0 0 0" />
    <axis xyz="0 0 -1" />
  </joint>
  <joint name="camera_tilt_joint" type="revolute">
    <parent link="base_link" />
    <child link="camera_tilt_link" />
    <origin xyz="0.09525 -0.018 -0.05218" rpy="0 0 0" />
    <axis xyz="0 -1 0" />
    <limit lower="-0.62832" upper="0.85172" effort="0.16" velocity="10.5" />
  </joint>
  <joint name="gripper_servo_joint" type="revolute">
    <parent link="base_link" />
    <child link="gripper_servo_link" />
    <origin xyz="-0.00225 0 -0.08462" rpy="0 0 0" />
    <axis xyz="1 0 0" />
    <!-- -120 deg = open, 0 = closed (toggle) -->
    <limit lower="-2.0944" upper="0" effort="0.18" velocity="10.5" />
  </joint>
  <joint name="gripper_rod_left_joint" type="revolute">
    <parent link="gripper_servo_link" />
    <child link="gripper_rod_left" />
    <origin xyz="0 -0.00927 -0.00008" rpy="0 0 0" />
    <axis xyz="1 0 0" />
    <limit lower="0" upper="2.08298" effort="1" velocity="20" />
    <mimic joint="gripper_servo_joint" multiplier="-0.9945" offset="0" />
  </joint>
  <joint name="gripper_rod_right_joint" type="revolute">
    <parent link="gripper_servo_link" />
    <child link="gripper_rod_right" />
    <origin xyz="0 0.00927 0.00007" rpy="0 0 0" />
    <axis xyz="1 0 0" />
    <limit lower="0" upper="1.78045" effort="1" velocity="20" />
    <mimic joint="gripper_servo_joint" multiplier="-0.8501" offset="0" />
  </joint>
  <joint name="gripper_jaw_left_joint" type="revolute">
    <parent link="base_link" />
    <child link="gripper_jaw_left" />
    <origin xyz="0.0025 0.03151 -0.0625" rpy="0 0 0" />
    <axis xyz="1 0 0" />
    <!-- positive = jaw swings out to +Y (opens) -->
    <limit lower="0" upper="0.73339" effort="1" velocity="10" />
    <mimic joint="gripper_servo_joint" multiplier="-0.3502" offset="0" />
  </joint>
  <joint name="gripper_jaw_right_joint" type="revolute">
    <parent link="base_link" />
    <child link="gripper_jaw_right" />
    <origin xyz="0.0025 -0.0315 -0.0625" rpy="0 0 0" />
    <axis xyz="1 0 0" />
    <!-- negative = jaw swings out to -Y (opens) -->
    <limit lower="-0.58991" upper="0" effort="1" velocity="10" />
    <mimic joint="gripper_servo_joint" multiplier="0.2817" offset="0" />
  </joint>
</robot>
